1504	 0784                        C	SETUP:
1505	                             C	
1506	                             C	; Inputs:
1507	                             C	;       DS:DI point to FCB
1508	                             C	;       DX:AX = Record position in file of disk transfer
1509	                             C	;       CX = Record count
1510	                             C	; Outputs:
